;Description
: Adds the username of the registered Fandom user who is viewing the page. If no user is logged in, the supplied alt text is displayed instead.
;Syntax
: {{t|USERNAME|alt text}}
: Optional '''''alt text''''' is what is displayed when no user is logged in. If nothing is supplied as alt text, users will see "<nowiki><insert name here></nowiki>" when not logged in.
;Examples
: "{{USERNAME|style=code}} is the best." will show "{{USERNAME}} is the best."
: '''If not logged in, you see…''' will show "<nowiki><insert name here></nowiki> is the best."
: <code><nowiki>[[Special:Mypage|{{USERNAME|Visitor}}'s userpage is good too]].</nowiki></code> will show "[[Special:Mypage|{{USERNAME|Visitor}}'s userpage is good too]]."
: '''If not logged in, you see…''' "[[Special:Mypage|Visitor's userpage is good too]]."
;Dependencies
: Add the following to the wiki's [[MediaWiki:ImportJS|ImportJS]] file. This is preferred.
<syntaxhighlight lang="javascript" style="margin-left:48px;">
dev:InputUsername/code.js 
</syntaxhighlight>
: Or add the following to the wiki's [[MediaWiki:Common.js|common js]] page.
<syntaxhighlight lang="javascript" style="margin-left:48px;">
importArticles({
    type: "script",
    articles: [
        "u:dev:MediaWiki:InputUsername/code.js"
    ]
});
</syntaxhighlight>
:See [[w:c:dev:InputUsername|InputUsername]] on [[w:c:dev|FANDOM Open Source Library]] for more information.
